<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kessel - Tea Brewing Timer</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4a7c59;
            --secondary: #d4b996;
            --accent: #8c5e3d;
            --light: #f8f5f0;
            --dark: #2c3e2f;
            --font-primary: 'Georgia', serif;
            --font-secondary: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            --font-size-h1: 3rem;
            --font-size-h2: 2rem;
            --font-size-h3: 1.5rem;
            --font-size-body: 1rem;
            --font-size-small: 0.875rem;
            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;
            --spacing-sm: 1rem;
            --spacing-md: 2rem;
            --spacing-lg: 3rem;
            --border-radius: 8px;
            --box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--dark);
            background-color: var(--light);
            font-size: var(--font-size-body);
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        section {
            padding: var(--spacing-lg) 0;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-secondary);
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: var(--font-size-h1);
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: var(--font-size-h2);
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: var(--font-size-h3);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            border: none;
            font-family: var(--font-secondary);
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover, .btn:focus {
            background-color: #3a6447;
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg) 0;
            background-color: var(--light);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: var(--font-size-h3);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: var(--spacing-md) auto;
        }

        /* Features */
        .features {
            background-color: white;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .feature-card {
            background-color: var(--light);
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        /* FAQ */
        .faq {
            background-color: var(--light);
        }

        .accordion-item {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
        }

        .accordion-header {
            padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .accordion-header:hover {
            background-color: #3a6447;
        }

        .accordion-header:focus {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
            outline-offset: -2px;
        }

        .accordion-content {
            padding: 0 var(--spacing-md);
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
        }

        .accordion-item.active .accordion-content {
            padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
            max-height: 500px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            h2 {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            section {
                padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
            }
            
            .hero p {
                font-size: var(--font-size-body);
            }
        }

        /* SVG Icons */
        svg {
            display: block;
            margin: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Kessel Tea Timer</h1>
            <p>Perfect tea brewing every time, with precision timing and elegant design.</p>
            <a href="#features" class="btn">Explore Features</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="features">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <svg class="feature-icon" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#4a7c59" stroke-width="2"/>
                        <path d="M12 6V12L16 14" stroke="#4a7c59" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    </svg>
                    <h3>Precision Timing</h3>
                    <p>Accurate countdown timers for perfect tea brewing.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <svg class="feature-icon" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" fill="#4a7c59"/>
                    </svg>
                    <h3>Elegant Design</h3>
                    <p>Clean, minimalist aesthetic that fits any kitchen.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <svg class="feature-icon" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M19.5 12c0 1.08-.71 1.99-1.73 2.26L15 16v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V16l-2.27-1.74C5.71 13.99 5 13.08 5 12c0-1.08.71-1.99 1.73-2.26L9 8v-1a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v1l2.27 1.74C18.29 10.01 19.5 10.92 19.5 12z" fill="#4a7c59"/>
                    </svg>
                    <h3>Smart Alerts</h3>
                    <p>Vibrant notifications when your tea is ready.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            
            <div class="accordion-item" tabindex="0">
                <button class="accordion-header">How accurate is the timing?</button>
                <div class="accordion-content">
                    <p>Kessel uses high-precision quartz oscillators with 1-second resolution, ensuring your tea is brewed to perfection every time.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="accordion-item" tabindex="0">
                <button class="accordion-header">What types of tea does it support?</button>
                <div class="accordion-content">
                    <p>Our timer supports all major tea categories including black, green, white, oolong, and herbal teas with customizable timing settings.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="accordion-item" tabindex="0">
                <button class="accordion-header">Is it easy to clean?</button>
                <div class="accordion-content">
                    <p>Yes! The entire device is waterproof and can be easily wiped down. The timer surface uses non-toxic, food-safe materials.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="accordion-item" tabindex="0">
                <button class="accordion-header">How long does the battery last?</button>
                <div class="accordion-content">
                    <p>With normal usage, Kessel's lithium-ion battery lasts up to 3 months. The low power indicator will notify you when it's time to recharge.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2023 Kessel Tea Timer. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const accordionItems = document.querySelectorAll('.accordion-item');
            
            accordionItems.forEach(item => {
                const header = item.querySelector('.accordion-header');
                
                // Toggle on click
                header.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    item.classList.toggle('active');
                });
                
                // Toggle with keyboard (Enter or Space)
                header.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
                    if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
                        e.preventDefault();
                        item.classList.toggle('active');
                    }
                });
                
                // Focus management
                header.addEventListener('focus', () => {
                    header.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
                });
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
